<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">Nehemiah</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Nehemiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hacaliah’ tapa Nehemiah’ thugen tam bang ahi hi. A kum sawmnina Chislev hla sungin kumpi khuopi Susa-a ka op lai tahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah pana pasal pawlkhat tawh ka sanggamte khat ahi Hananiah ang tung a, tuale keima in amate kungah sala kiman lo a hinglai Judah mite thu le Jerusalem thu ka dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in, “Sala kiman lo tua gam sunga a omsuohte in gentheina lienpi le maizumna a thuoh uhi; Jerusalem kulpi kicim gawp a, a tunkotte zong mei in katum zo hi, “ci-in ang gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua thu ka zah ciengin tosuhin ka kap a, ni tampi sung kap le mau-in vantung Pasien kungah antangin thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in, “Aw Topa , Vantung Pasien, nang ang it a, na thupiehnate a zui mite tungah thuciemna limtaha a zui, a lien le a giinhuoi Pasien aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />sun le zanin na nasem Israel mite adinga kang thungetna a ngai dingin na bil ei ngat inlen, na mit hing hahsah in. Keima le ka innkuonpite-a kipan ko Israel mite in na tunga kang bawlsa uh mawnate kang pulah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma tungah nahpitahin kang khiel kha ta vua, na nasempa Moses tunga na thupiehnate, thukhamte, le ngaina kipte ka zui ta sih uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na nasempa Moses tungah, ‘Nohaw na muonhuoi sih uleh mite lahah kang thezah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hizongle ka kunga nang kilekia vua, ka thupiehnate na zui uleh, a gamla pen leimong dongah nawdawhin om nan locin, keima in khum panin kang kaikhawmkia ding a, ka min om nadinga ka teelsa munah note kang zawpi ding hi,’ ci-a na thugen hing phawhkia bo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate pen nangma’ vanglietna le a thahat nangma’ khut tawh na tatkhietsa nangma’ nasemte le nangma’ mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa aw, na nasempa’ ang thumna le na min a zatah nuom na nasemte’ thumna na bil hing daw in. Tuni-in na nasempa tungah guolzawna ei pie inlen, tam mipa muna-ah hepina ei pie bo in!” ci-in thu ka ngen hi. Khum hunin kei pen kumpipa’ hai tawipa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Artaxerxes in a uh zaw a kum sawmnina Nisan hla-in, lenggazu pieh ding hun ciengin lenggazu tawi-in kumpipa ka pie hi. Ni dangin ama mai-ah damai-in ka om ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in keima kungah, “A cina lah hi lo bang dinga damai na hei? Na dana khat om hi ngel ding hi,” ei ci hi. Tua ciengin zau citahin ka zau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima in kumpipa kungah, “Kumpipa hing denden in! Ka pu ka pate kivuina han opna mun ahi khuopi kisie-in a tunkotte zong mei in katum sieng ta ahi ziehin damai lo-in bangci op thei ding ka hei?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in keima kungah, “Bang ngen nuom na hei?” ei ci hi. Tuaci’n keima in vantung Pasien kungah thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in kumpipa kungah, “Kumpipa na lung a kim a, na nasempa in na maipha ka mu khah leh, ka pu ka pate’ han opna khuopi ka va lamkia thei nadingin Judah gamah ei hawsah in,” ci-in ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa in (kumpinu zong a gei-ah a to hi) keima kungah, “Pei lacin bang tanvei va tham ding a, bang huna hing kilekia ding na hei?” ei ci hi. Tuaci’n kumpipa in ka pei ding ei lungkimpi a, kei zong hun khat ka se hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in kumpipa kungah, “Kumpipa na thukim leh, Judah gam ka tun masangsie amate in ei peisah thei nadingun Gungal gamkhen a uhte ka pieh ding laihlahte ei puosah in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuale kumpipa’ gammang tulah kempa Asaph in biehinn kulpi tunkot zawlte, khuopi kul le keima’ inn lam nading sing ei pieh nadingin thupiehna lai zong ei puosah in,” ka ci hi. Keima tungah hepi siem ka Pasien’ khut om ahi ziehin kumpipa in ka nget teng ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gungal gamkhen a uhte kungah ka tung a, keima in kumpipa’ laihlahte amate ka pie hi. Kumpipa in galkapmangte le sakol galkapte kei ei hlasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Horon-te le Sanballat le Ammon milien Tobiah-te in Israel mite’ phattuomna sem dingin mi khat ang pei hi, ci thu a zah ciengun nahpitahin lungkim lo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jerusalam ah ka tung a, ni thum sung ka tam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin zanin keima le ka zawpi mi tawmno khatte tawh ka tho hi; Jerusalem adinga ka bawlpieh ding ka Pasien in ka lungsim sunga ei guot thute koima kungah ka gen vawt sih hi. Keima tuonna ganhing sim lo ganhing dang ka zawpi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zanin Kuom Tunkot panin pusuohin Gulpi Tuikhuh le Buathah Tunkot lamah ka pei a, a kicimsa Jerusalem kulpi teng le mei in a kahtumsa a tunkotte ka va en ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Tuinah Tunkot le Kumpipa’ Buol dong ka peisuoh hi; ahi vangin ka tuonna ganhing pei thei nading mun a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n kuom lampi tawnin zan lai-in khuopi kul ka vel hi. Tua ciengin ka kinuahei a, Kuom Tunkot ah lutin ka kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei hei-ah pei-in bang teng bawl ka hei, ci uliente in ei thei sih uhi; keima in na sem dingte ahi Jews-te, siempute, mi thupite, uliente le adangte kungah ka vai ka gen nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kungah, “Tam mun a i lungkhamna thu na thei uhi. Jerusalem a kisusie ta a, a tunkotte zong mei in a katum ta hi. Hing pei un, zakona i thuoh nawn lo nadingin Jerusalem kulpi ciengpha kia vai,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima in ka tunga ka Pasien in ang bawl hepina le kumpipa in ka tunga ang gen thute amate kungah ka gen hi. Tua ciengin amate in, “Nasep kipan pai vai!” ei ci uhi. Tuaci’n amate zong tangpi phattuomna dingin a kipumpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hizongle Horon-te Sanballat, Ammon milien Tobiah, le Arab-te Geshem in tua thu a zah ciengun amate in, “Tami na sil bawl uh bang ahei? Kumpipa ledo sawm na hi uh amah?” ci-in simmawna tawh ei ehneh ho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in amate kungah, “Lawcinna ei guon ding pen vantung Pasien ahi a, tuale ko ama’ nasemte in nasep ka kipan ta ding uhi; hinanle note in Jerusalem ah tanh ahi a, nget ding ahi a, tangthu lam panin ahi zongin nga ding hamphatna bangma na nei sih uhi,” ci-in ka dawngkia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu lien pa Eliashib in a siempu seppite tawh Tuu Tunkot a bawlpha uhi. Amate in siensuo-in a kotkhahte a bul vua, Zakhat Tausang cieng dong le Hananel Tausang cieng dong a siensuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale ama’ zomah Jericho mite in lam uhi. Amate zaw ciengin Imri’ tapa Zaccur in lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hassenaah’ tapate in Nga Tunkot a lam uhi; amate in a zawlte a hlung vua, tuale a kotkhahte, a kotgolhte a siatunte a bul uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau’ zomah Hakkoz’ tapa Uriah, a tapa Meremoth in puo hi. Amate zaw ciengin Meshezabel, a tapa Meshullam in puo hi. Amate zaw ciengin Banna’ tapa Zadok in puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate zomah Tekoa-te in a puo uhi; ahi vangin a Topa uh’ nasepna-ah a miliente uh a hapan nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tunkot Lui pen Paseah’ tapa Joiada, le Besodeiah’ tapa Meshullam in a puo uhi; amate in a zawlte a hlung vua, a kotkhahte, a kotgolhte, le a siatunte a bul uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate zomah Gibeon-te Melatiah le Meronoth-te Jadon in Gungal gamkhen a uhpa’ thuneina sunga a om Gibeon-te le Mizpah-te tawh a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate zomah khamkhengte khat ahi Harhaiah’ tapa Uzziel in puo hi. Ama zomah sathau namtui bawlte khat ahi Hananiah in puo hi; tuale amate in Kulpi Lien dongin Jerusalem a ngai a bangsah kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amahaw zomah Jerusalem gam phalkhat a uh Hur’ tapa Rephaiah in puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate zomah Harumaph’ tapa Jedaiah in ama’ inn tawh kimaingat son teng puo hi; tuale ama zomah Hashabneiah’ tapa Hattush in puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Harim’ tapa Malchijah le Pahath-moab’ tapa Hasshub in Meikhuh Tausang le khawh dang khat puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama zomah Jerusalem phalkhat a uh Hallohesh’ tapa Shallum le a tanute in puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hanun le Zanoah-a tengte in Kuom Tunkot a puo uhi; amahawn a zawlte a hlung vua, a kotkhahte, a kotgolhte, le a siatunte a bul uhi, tuale kulpi tong tulkhat sung Buathah Tunkot dong a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Beth-haccherem gam phalkhat a uh Rechab’ tapa Malchijah in Buathah Tunkot puo hi; ama in a kotkhahte, a kotgolhte, le a siatunte a bawlphakia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale Mizpah gam a uh Col-hozeh’ tapa Shallum in Tuinah Tunkot puo hi; ama in tua tunkot bawlpha a, a tung khu-in a kotkhahte, a kotgolhte, le a siatunte bul hi; tuale ama in kumpipa’ um sunga om Shelah buol kulpi zong David’ khuopi pana kidawsuh kalei dongin bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama zomah Beth-zur gam phal langkhat a uh Azbuk’ tapa Nehemiah in David’ han tawh a kimaingat mun panin a kisiemthu tuikhuh le galhangte’ inn dong a puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama zomah a puo Levi mite: Bani’ tapa Rehum; ama zomah Keilah gam phal langkhat a uh Hashabiah in ama’ gam tangin a puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama zomah a puo a unaute: Keilah gam phal langkhat a uh Henadad’ tapa Binnui;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ama zomah Mizpah uhpa Jeshua’ tapa Ezer in Kulning-a galvan kikoina katona tawh a kimaingat khawh dang khat puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama zomah Zabbai’ tapa Baruch in Kulning panin siempu lien pa Eliashib’ inn kotkhah dong puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama zomah Hakkoz’ tapa Uriah, a tapa Meremoth in Eliashib’ inn kotkhah panin innmong dong puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama zomah a kim a pam-a om siempute in puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate zaw ciengin Benjamin le Hasshub in ama gel’ inn tawh a kimaingat teng puo uhi. Ama gel zaw ciengin Ananiah’ tapa Masseiah, a tapa Azariah in a inn tawh a kimaingat teng a puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama zaw ciengin Henadad’ tapa Binnui in mun tuomdang khat, Azariah’ inn panin Kulning dong puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uzai’ tapa Palal in Kulning tawh a kigalsaina mun teng le kumpipa’ inn pana a dawhkhie, zumcingte’ opna tausang tungnung teng puo hi. Ama zomah Parosh’ tapa Pedaiah in puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ophel tunga a teng biehinn nasemte in ni suona lam, Tui Tunkot tawh a kimaingat teng le tausang dawh puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama banah Tekoa-te in tausang dawhpi tawh a kimaingat teng le Ophel kulpi dong puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sakol Tunkot tung son teng ahile siempute in a inn ciet utawh a kimaingat teng a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amahaw zomah Immer’ tapa Zadok in ama’ inn tawh a kimaingat son teng puo hi. Ama zomah Shecaniah’ tapa, Nisuona Kotcingpa Shemaiah in a puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama zomah Shelemiah’ tapa Hannaniah, Zalaph’ tapa guhna Hanun in khawh dang khat a puo uhi. Ama zomah Berechiah’ tapa Meshullam in ama’ lupna khan tawh a kimaingat son teng puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama zaw ciengin khamkhengte khat ahi Machijah in biehinn nasemte’ inn le sumbawlte’ inn cieng, le Kikhopna Tunkot tawh a kimaingat son teng, le Kulning inndan tungnung cieng dong puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kulning inndan tungnung le Tuu Tunkot kikal pen khamkhengte le sumbawlte in puo uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in ka kulpi cien lam uh Sanballat in a zah ciengin lungthah mama a, ama in Jews-te a zako gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in ama’ kithuopite le Samaria galkapte mai-ah, “Tua Jew miginalote bang bawl uh ahei? Amate in nate a puophat sawm uh amah? Biehpiehna bawl ding ahi uh amah? Ni khat thu-in a man zo ding uh amah? Buathah lom lah panin a kavamsa suongte la-in puokia ding ahi uh amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’ gei-a om Ammon-te Tobiah in, “A cien uh suongte tungah ngie khatpo kato leh cimsuh pai lel ven!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kote’ Pasien aw, ei ngai in; azieh pen kote ei kisimmaw hi; amau’ ei kosietna teng amau’ lutung ma-ah tusah inlen, saltanna gam khatah mite’ tomgam dingin amate piedawh ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau’ khielna khupieh sinlen, na muna panin amau’ mawna phietmang sin; bangzieh ahei cile amate in kulciengte mai-ah kote ei zako uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n kote in kulpi ka ciengpha kia vua, tuale kulpi buppi’ a sanna alang cieng kizo hi; azieh pen mite in kinna lungsim a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin Sanballat, Tobiah, le Arab-te, Ammon-te, le Ashdod-te in Jerusalem kulpite cienphatna nasep kizom suohin, kulvang teng huhbih ding kipan zo hi, ci a zah ciengun a lungthah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate a unpi-un a kuon vua, tuale Jerusalem simin a sungah a buoisah sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n kohawn zong ka Pasien uh kungah thu ka ngen vua, amate a dal dingin sun le zanin galvil ka koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin Judah in, “Van puo mite a tha uh a zaw gawp ta hi, buathah lah a tam ta mama a, tuaci’n kote in kulpi ka cieng zo nawn sih uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuale ka galte un, “A thei lo kalun ei mu masangun amate kungah va pei-in i va that ta ding a, a nasep uh i dinkhawlsah ding hi,” ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amau’ gei-a teng Jew mite ang pei ciengun amate in ko kungah, “Kote ei sim dingin a tenna uh mun zosie panin ang kuonto ding uhi,” ci-in sawmvei vilvel ei gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in kulpi nualam mun ngiem penna mun-awng tengah a namsau uh, a teipi ule a thal utawh a innkuon kuonun ka pangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam teng ka van zaw ciengin mi thupite, uliente le a omlai mite kungah, “Amahaw giing sih un. Na sanggamte, na tapate, na tanute, na zite ule na innte uh adinga ang do pieh, a lien le a giinhuoi Topa phawh un,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka galte’ ei sawmna teng kote in ka thei lam ule Pasien in amau’ gelna teng a susiet zo lam amate in a zah ciengun, ka unpi-un ka nasepna uh kulpi cietah ka kuonkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum ni-a kipanin ka nasemte alang in na semin, alang in teipite, lumte, thalpite, le awmdalte a tawi uhi; tuale Judah innkuon buppi’ nua-ah makaite a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kulpi-a cien ding van a nawn mite in a khut langkhat utawh a van puoh uh tu-in a khut langkhat utawh galhiem a tawi vua, tua bangin na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale innlamte in a nasep pumun a kawng vuah namsau a kuo uhi. Ka gei-ah pengkul mut pa a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale keima in mi thupite, uliente, le adang mite kungah, “Nasepna lienin zaipi tah a huom a, kulpi tungah eite khatlekhat kikhenin gamlapi i kihal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n pengkul aw na zah ciengun ka kungah hing kikhawm un. I Pasien in eihaw adingin gal ei dopieh ding hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n na ka sem vua, amate alang in phalvah panin aasi suo dongin teipi a tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khum hunin keima in zong mite kungah, “Zanin galvilin sunin na a sep thei nadingun mi zosie a nasemte ciet utawh Jerusalem ah hing gieh ta un,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima hileng, ka sanggamte hile, ka nasemte hile, ka nua ei zuite keima ei cingte in hile, ka puon uh ka suo man ngai sih uhi; mi khat cietin a khut ziet lamah a galhiem a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in mite le a zite un a unau uh Judah mite tungah lungkim lona lienpi khat a gingsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen mi pawlkhat in, “Ka tanute ule ka tapate utawh ka kunta mama uhi; kote in an ne-in ka hin thei nadingun an ka sui uh kul hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawlkhat in zong, “Kote in kiel hun sungin an lei nadingin ka lote uh, ka lengga umte ule ka innte uh vankhapin ka pieh uh kul ding hi,” ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuale mi pawlkhatte in, “Kumpipa’ sieh pieh dingin ka lote ule ka lengga umte uh khamin sum ka palah uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ko pen ka unaute utawh si khat sa khat ka hi uhi; ka tate uzong amau’ tate ma bang ahi uhi; hinanle ka tapate ule ka tanute uh nuom lopipi-in sal dingin ka pausawl mawh vua, tuale ka tanute uh pawlkhat ei na kisuhthangpieh zo ta hi; ka lote ule ka lengga umte uh midangte’ neisa suoh ta ahi ziehin tuate tat nading bangma ka bawl zo sih uhi,” ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in a kikona ule tam bang phunnate ka zah ciengin ka lung thah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in tam thu tungtang ka lungngai zaw ciengin, mi thupite le uliente ka mawsah hi; tuale keima in amate kungah, “Nohaw zosie in na unaute uh tungah sum met na la uhi,” ka ci hi. Tua thu teng kaituo nadingin keima in kikhopna thupi khat ka hlan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuale amate kungah, “Minam dangte’ khut sungah sala kizuasa Judah i unaute i hi zawhna za utawh i tankia vua, hizongle tu-in note in na zua uh na mipite i tatkia lo uh a phamaw ahi hi!” ka ci hi. Gen ding thei loin amate a sip dide uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in, “Na sil bawl uh pen a hoi vawt sih hi. Eite in i galte ahi minam dangte’ zakona i thuoh lo nadingin i Pasien zatahna tawh na gamtat ding uh kilawm hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua tham loin, keima le ka sanggamte, le ka nasemte in amate sum le an ka palahsah uhi. Tami a met lahna mawngmawng khawlsah va vui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuni mama-in amate kung pana na lahpiehsa teng uh: a lo, a lengga um, olive um, a innte ule a met tawh na lah uh sum, an, lenggazu, le sathaute amate tungah piekia un,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in, “Tua teng zosie ka piekia ding vua, amate kung panin bangma dang ka ngen nawn sih ding uhi. Na gen bangin ka gamta ding uhi,” ei ci uhi. Keima in siempute hlanin a ciemsa bangun a gamtat nadingun ka kiciemsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in zong ka puonte thingin, “Tam kamciem a pel poma a inn le a neisa panin Pasien in thingkhie taheh. Tua bangin amate kithingkhie dawh hinlen hawmsuoh taheh!” ka ci hi. A kikhawm zosie in, “Hi taheh,” ci-in Topa a phat uhi. Tuale a kamciemsa uh bangin mite a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua tham loin Judah gam uhpa dinga ei kise hun a kipan, Kumpi Artaxerxes a maan a kum sawmnina panin sawmthum le nina dong, kum sawm le kum ni sung, keima le ka sanggamte in gam uhte’ nga ding ante ka ne sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei mai-a gam uhte’ na semte in mite tungah vangih a na suon vua, tuale ngun shekel sawmli banah amate tung panin an le lenggazu a na la uhi. Amau’ nasemte nangawn in mi tungah thu nei nuom lai vaset uhi. Hizongle keima in Pasien giing ka hi ziehin tua bangin ka gamta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tami kulcienna-ah kei mama in ka sem a, leitang bangma ka la vawt sih hi; tuale na sem dingin ka nasemte zosie tua munah a kisutuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua tham loin kim le pam minamte kung pana ang peite sim lo, ka sabuoi-ah an a ne, Jew-te le uliente lahah mi za le sawmnga pha den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni khat neh dingin bawngtang luong khat, a kituomteel tuu luong guh kigo hi; keima adingin aa-te zong kigo a, ni sawm a cin sielin savun um tampi dimin lenggazu kibawl hi; tua za-in tawp tama nanle keima in gam uhte’ nga ding anneh ka kal sih hi; azieh pen mipite genthei luo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka Pasien aw, keima in tam mite dinga ka bawlsa zosie keima dingin a hoi lamin ei phawh in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in keima in kulpi ka cien zona thu le a vang khat zong a op nawn lona thu, Sanballat, Tobiah le Arab-te Geshem le ka galdangte zosie kungah a kigen ciengin, (khum hun laitahin tunkot tengah kotkhahte ka bul nai lo vangin)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sanballat le Geshem in, “Hing pei inlen Ono zanglei-a khuoneu khatah kimutuo vai,” ci-in ei thuta uhi. Ahi vangin amate pen keima tunga sietna bawl sawm ahi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate kungah kamtaite ka sawl a, “Nasep golpi ka sep laitah ahi ziehin kang peisuh thei sih hi. Note kunga kang peisuh kalin bang dingin nasep nuasie-in kikhawl ding ahei?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua bangin li vei tah ei thuta vua, a masa bang ma-in ka dawngkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua bangin a ngaveina-ah Sanballat in keima kungah a nasempa hing sawlin ama’ khutah a kihongsa laihlah khat ang tawisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A laihlah sungah, “Minamte lahah a kigen- Geshem in zong ei gen thu in- nangma le Jew-te in nei ledo sawm uhi; tua ahi ziehin note in kulpi na cieng uhi; tuale tami thu a kigenna danah nangma zong amau’ kumpi sem nuom dan na hi mel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma in, ‘Judah gamah kumpi khat om zo ta!’ ci-in nangma tawh kisai thu tangko dingin kamsangte zong na koi zo ta mel hi. Tuale tami kammalte dung zui-in kumpipa kunga thu kipuoh ding ahi ta hi. Tua ahi ziehin hing pei inlen kikumton vai,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in ama kungah, “Na gen bangin tua thute kibawl lo hi; tuate pen na lungsim sunga na mawh phuotawm ahi bo hi,” ci-in ka gensahkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen amate zosie in ei galgih nuom vua, “A nasep ban uh hing tuolkhieh va-un, sep loin hing om na va,” ci-in ngaituo uhi. Ahi vangin tu-in Pasien aw, ka khutte hing thahatsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni khat, ama’ inn sunga a kulcip Mehetabel’ tapa Delaiah, a tapa Shemaiah kungah ka va haw ta leh ama in, “Pasien’ biehinnpi-a biehbuh sungah kikhawm tonin biehbuh kotte khah vai, azieh pen nangma that dingin amate ang pei ding uhi; nang ang that dingin tuzanin amate ang pei valon ding uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima in, “Mi kei bangte tai va nei ci tamawng amah? A hinna humbit dingin mi kei bangte biehinn sungah lut talawm va nei ci amah? Lut buong lo e!” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin tuapa pen Pasien sawl na hi vawt loin, Sanballat le Tobiah-te in a thap zieh vua, keima lang khatah tua bang teng ang gen ahi lam ka mukhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in ei zausahin tam bangin gamta-in mawna ka bawl thei nading ngimna le, tuaci’n amate in keima ei galgih thei nadingun minsiet puomsiet ei tansah nop zieh vua ama na kiciel ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka Pasien aw, amate in tam thu teng a bawl uh dung zui-in Tobiah le Sanballat, kamsang numei Noadiah le keima ei zausah nuom adang kamsangte na thei gige in,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n Elul hla ni sawmni le ni nga ni-in kulpi bawl kizo a, ni sawmnga le ni ni sawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka galte zosie in tua thu a zah ciengun ka kimvel vua a om minamte zosie a zau vua, zong mai nei a kisa nawn sih uhi; bangzieh ahei cile tami nasep pen ka Pasien uh’ panpina tawh a kimuolsuo ahi lam amate in a thei ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua banah khum hun lai-in Judah mithupite in Tobiah kungah lai tampi a na hlah vua, Tobiah’ laihlahte zong a na nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama pen Arah’ tapa Shecaniah’ mahpa hi a, Berechiah’ tapa Meshullam’ tanu tawh a tapa Jehohanan a kinun ziehin ama tawh Judah gama mi tampite kiciemin a kipawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in a silbawl hoite zong ka mai-ah ang gen vua, keima gen teng zong ama kungah a na tut uhi. Tuale Tobiah in ka zau theithei nadingin keima tungah lai tampi ei hlah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in kulcien kiman siengin kotkhahte ka bul zo ta a, tunkotcingte, lasate, le Levi-te nasep a kiguot zaw ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />keima in Jerusalem a kem dingin ka sanggampa Hanani tawh kulpi a uhpa Hananiah ka seton hi, azieh pen ama midang tampite sanga a muonhuoizaw le Pasien a giingzaw khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale keima in ama gel kungah, “Ni a sat laisie Jerusalem tunkotte kihong lo ding hi; tunkot cingte in a cin laitahin tuate khahsah inlen, kotte golhsah un. Jerusalem-a tengte lah panin galvil ding se unlen, pawlkhat a galvilna mun vuah, pawlkhatte amau’ inn mai cietah pangsah un,” ci-in ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuopi golin zai a, ahi vangin a sunga teng mi tawmin innte kilam nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin khanggui ciemtena bangin mithupite, uliente le mite kaikhawmin a min uh khum ding Pasien in ka lungsim sungah ang suohsah hi. Tuale keima in ang kilekia masate’ khanggui ciemtena laibu ka mu a, khum sunga na kigiel ka mute tam bang teng ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in suoh le sal-a a peipina mun panin gam sunga hing peito mite tam teng ahi uhi; amate in Jerusalem le Judah gam sung a khuo ciet zuonin a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Azariah, Raamiah, Nahamani, Mordekai, Bilshan, Mispereth, Bigvai, Nehum, Baanah-te tawh peiton uhi. Israel-te a mi phaza pen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Parosh suonte, mi tulni zakhat le sawm sagi le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Shephatiah suonte, mi zathum sawmsagi le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Arah suonte, mi zaguh sawmnga le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pahath-moab suonte sung panin, Jeshua le Joab suonte, mi tulni zagiet le sawm le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elam suonte, mi tulkhat zani sawmnga le li ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zattu suonte, mi zagiet sawmli le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zaccai suonte, mi zasagi sawmguh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Binnui suonte, mi zaguh sawmli le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bebai suonte, mi zaguh sawmni le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azgad suonte, mi tulni zathum sawmni le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Adonikam suonte, mi zaguh sawmguh le sagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bigvai suonte, mi tulni sawmguh le sagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adin suonte, mi zaguh sawmnga le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ater a kici Hezekiah’ suonte, mi sawmkuo le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hashum suonte, mi zathum sawmni le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bezai suonte, mi zathum sawmni le li ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hariph suonte, mi zakhat sawm le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gibeon suonte, mi sawmkuo le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bethlehem le Netophah-te, mi zakhat sawmgiet le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anathoth-te, mi zakhat sawmni le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Beth-azmaveth-te, mi sawmli le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim, Chephirah, le Beeroth-te, mi zasagi sawmli le thum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ramah le Gaba-te, mi zaguh sawmni le khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Michmash-te, mi zakhat sawmni le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bethel le Ai-te, mi zakhat sawmni le thum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nebo adang khat-te, mi sawmnga le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Elam adang khat-te, mi tulkhat zani sawmnga le li ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Harim-te, mi zathum le sawmni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jericho-te, mi zathum sawmli le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lod, Hadid, le Ono-te, mi zasagi sawmni le khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Shenaah-te, mi tulthum zakuo sawmthum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Siempute sung panin: Jeshua-te innkuon pan Jedaih suonte, mi zakuo sawm sagi le thum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Immer suonte, mi tulkhat sawmnga le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pashur suonte, mi tulkhat zani sawmli le sagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Harim suonte, mi tulkhat sawm le sagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Levi-te sung panin: Jeshua suonte, Hodevah suon Kadmiel a kicite, mi sawmsagi le li ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Lasate sung panin Asaph suonte, mi zakhat sawmli le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Kotcingte nam sung panin Shallum suonte, Ater suonte, Talmon suonte, Akkub suonte, Hatita suonte, le Shobai suonte, mi zakhat sawmthum le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Biehinn tuonvaite sung panin: Ziha suonte, Hasupha suonte, Tabbaoth suonte
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Keros suonte, Sia suonte, Padon suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Lebana suonte, Hagaba suonte, Shalmai suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hanan suonte, Giddel suonte, Gahar suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Reaiah suonte, Rezin suonte, Nekoda suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Gazzam suonte, Uzza suonte, Paseah suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Besai suonte, Meunim suonte, Nephushesim suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Bakbuk suonte, Hakupha suonte, Harhur suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Bazlith suonte, Mehida suonte, Harsha suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Barkos suonte, Sisera suonte, Tamah suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Neziah suonte, Hatipha suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Solomon nasemte’ suonte, Sotai suonte, Sophereth suonte, Perida suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jaala suonte, Darkon suonte, Giddel suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Shephatiah suonte, Hattil suonte, Pochereth-hazzebaim suonte, le Amon suonte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Biehinn tuonvaite le Solomon nasemte’ suonte a unpi-in zathum sawmkuo le ni pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tam teng pen Tel-melah, Tel-haresha, Cherub, Addon, le Immer-te pana ang peito mite ahi uhi, ahi vangin amate in a pupate uh’ innkuon ahi sihle amau’ pienna khanggui a sut thei sih vua, Israel mi ahile ahi lo lam zong a kitel sih uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Delaiah suonte, Tobiah suonte, Nekoda suonte, mi zaguh sawmli le ni pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Siempute sungah zong: Habaiah suonte, Koz suonte, Barzillai suonte (Gilead-te Barzillai’ tanute khat tawh ama kinungin tua min tawh kilo pah ahi hi) ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tam mite in khanggui ciemtena laibu sunga a kiciemte mite lahah a min uh a sui vangun a mu zo sih vua, tuaci’n amate pen a bua-in kikoi-in a siempu hina panun kikhawlsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Urim le Thummim aisanna tawh a siensuo dingin siempu khat a tun masangsie an siengtho pente a neh lo nading uh gam uhpa in amate kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Mi buppi tul sawmli le tulni le za thum sawmguh pha a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />amau’ nasem numei le pasal tulsagi zathum sawmthum le sagite kisim lo hi; tuale amate in lasa numei le pasal zani sawmli nga nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Amate in sakolte zasagi sawmthum le guh, laa-sakol zani sawmli le nga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />kalaoh zali sawmthum nga, le laavai tulguh le zasagi sawmni nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Tu-in nasep nadingin pupa innkuon lutang pawlkhatte a kipie uhi. Gam uhpa in sumkholna-ah kham darics tulkhat, kuongkum sawmnga, le siempu puon zanga sawmthum a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Tuale pupa innkuon lutang pawlkhat in sumkholna-ah kham darics tul sawmni le ngun mina tulni zani a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Midangte’ pieh pen kham darics tul sawmni, ngun mina tulni, le siempu puon sil sawmguh le sagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Tuaci’n siempute, Levi-te, tunkot cingte, lasate, mi pawlkhatte, biehinn tuonvaite, le Israel zosie a khuopi ciet vuah a teng uhi. A hla sagina ciengin amau’ khuopi cietah -Israel mite a teng uhi-
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />mi zosie Tui Tunkot mai tuolpi-ah a kisutuo uhi. Topa in Israel tunga a pieh Moses thukham laibu ang tawi nadingin amate in laithei pa Ezra kungah a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ma bangin a hla sagina, a ni masa ni-in siempu Ezra in theitelna tawh a za thei ding numei pasal a kikhawmte mai-ah thukham laibu a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tui Tunkot mai tuol-awnga numei pasal le a thei dingte opna mun lam kinga a, ama in zingmawng tung panin sunkim dong, tua laibu sung pana thute a sim hi; tuale mi zosie in thukham sunga om thute lunglutin a bildaw ngiam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thugenna dinga singpeh tawh a kibawl dawsang tungah laithei pa Ezra ding a, Mattithiah, Shema, Anaiah, Uriah, Hilkiah le Maaseiah-te a ziet lamah, Pedaih, Mishael, Malchijah, Hashum, Hash-baddanah, Zechariah le Meshullum-te a vei lamah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale mi zosie sangin a sangzaw munah Ezra a din ziehin mi zosie muna-ah laibu a phen hi; tuale ama in tua laibu a phen ciengin mi zosie a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ezra in a lien Pasien, Topa thupha pie a, mipite in a khut uh lamto-in, “Hi taheh,” ci-in a dawng uhi. Tua ciengin amate lukunin Topa a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amau’ opna cietah mite a op sungun mite in thukham a tel thei nadingun Jeshua, Bani, Sherebiah, Jamin, Akkub, Shabbethai, Hodiah, Maaseiah, Kelita, Azariah, Jozabad, Hanan, Pelaiah, le Levi-te in zong a panpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Pasien’ thukham laibu sung panin a khietna gen kawmin a sim vua, tua a kisim thute a tel nadingun a hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale gam uhpa Nehemiah, laithei pa le siempu Ezra, le mite thu a hil Levi-te in mi zosie kungah, “Tuni pen Topa na Pasien uh dinga ni siengtho ahi hi; a kap a mau om sih un,” a ci hi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate in thukham kammalte a zah ciengun mi zosie a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in amate kungah, “Na lapi sung vuah pei-in a thaute ne-in zu a hlum nono dawn unlen, bangma a kibawlpieh lote zong va thah ta un, bangzieh ahei cile i Topa adingin tuni pen ni siengtho ahi hi; da sih un, azieh pen Topa’ kipahna khu note’ hatna ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Levi-te in, “Sip dide un; azieh pen tuni khu ni siengtho ni ahi hi; da sih un,” ci-in mi zosie a sipsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuale mi zosie in amate kunga kigen thute a tel thei ziehun anne tui dawnin a om vua, midangte an thah ding le a guolnuom dingin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ni ni ni-in pupa innkuon lutangte zosie, siempute le Levi-te tawh thukham sin dingin laithei pa Ezra kungah a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuale a hla sagina pawi hun sungin buhte sungah Israel mite a ten nading thu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />le a khuopi zosie ule Jerusalem khuopi-ah amate tangko-in, “A kigielsa bangin buhte lam nadingin muol tungah pei unlen, olive bate, gam olive bate, mui singbate, lutu bate, le a napha singte va la ta un,” ci-in Moses tungtawnin a gen ding uh, Topa thupiehna pen thukham laibu sunga a kigiel lam a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n mite pei-in singnate a la vua, amau’ innkhum tung ciet, a leituolte ciet uh, le Pasien’ biehinn leituol, Tui Tunkot tuol, le Ephraim Tunkot tuol tengah buhte a lam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale saltanna pana a kilekia mi zosie in buhte a lam uhi. Azieh pen Nun’ tapa Joshua’ huna kipan khum ni dongin Israel mite in tua bangin a bawl ngai sih uhi. Tuale lungdamna nahpi tahin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale ama in ni masa ni-a kipanin a ni tawp dong, nisielin Pasien’ thukham laibu a simkhie hi. Amate in ni sagi sung pawi a bawl uhi; tuale ngaina om bangin a ni giet ni-in kikhopna thupi khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hla ni sawmni le ni li ni-in Israel mite in antangin la-ip puon silin a kikhawm vua, a lu tung vuah leivui a kibuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin gamdang mi zosie sung panin Israel cihlah teng a tuomin a om vua, dinsa-in amau’ mawnate le a pu a pate uh’ khielnate pulahin a thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amau’ opna mun cietah dingin, Topa a Pasien uh’ thukham laibu ni khat’ seli-suo-sekhat sung a sim vua, adang seli-suo-sekhat pen mawna pulahna-in nei-in, Topa a Pasien a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Levi-te’ kalei tungah Jeshua, Bani, Kadmiel, Shebaniah, Bunni, Sherebiah, Bani le Chenani dingin Topa a Pasien kung vuah nahpi tahin a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Levi-te Jeshua, Kadmiel, Bani, Hashabneiah, Sherebiah, Hodiah, Shebaniah, le Pethahiah-te in, “Dingto unlen, tawntung panin tawntung dongin Topa na Pasien uh patawi un. Thupha namcin le patawina teng tungah a kitawisang vanglien na min in thupha nga taheh,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale Ezra in, “Nang beh Topa na hi hi; nang in a sang pen vantung le vantungte-a om zosie, leitung le a tunga a om zosie, tuipi le a sunga a om zosie na siem hi. Nang in tua teng zosie tungah hinna na pie a, van mihonpite in nang ang bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang in Abram teelin Chaldea-te’ Ur pan peipi-in Abraham min a phuo pa Topa Pasien na hi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuale na mai-ah ama’ lungsim a muonhuoi lam na mu a, Canaan-te gam, Hit-te gam, Amor-te gam, Perez-te gam, Jebus-te gam, le Girgash-te gam teng, ama le a suonlehlahte tungah pieh dingin ama tawh thuciem khat na bawl hi; nang in na kamciem na tungsah hi, azieh pen nang na thuman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tuale nang in Egypt gam sunga ka pu ka pate uh’ gentheina na mu a, San Tuipi -a amau’ kikona na za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in kihisahna tawh ka pu ka pate uh a bawl gawpna uh thei na hi ziehin, Pharaoh le ama’ nasemte zosie, le a gam sunga mi zosie’ langkhatah lim le na lamdangte na bawl hi. Nangma ading min khat na bawl a, tua khu tuni dongin a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuale amate in leigaw tunga tuipi a kantan thei nadingun nangma in a masang vuah gunpi phalni na suo a, ahi vangin nangma in amahaw a nuadelte tuihuol sunga suongse bangin tuithuh sung sena-in na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua tham loin, nangma in amate a pei thei nadingun a lampi uh a salvah dingin sunin meii khuom, zanin mei khuom tawh na zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangma zong Sinai muol tungah kumsuhin vantung panin amate na hopi a, tuale amate thukhenna a man, thukham tahtah, ngaina hoite le thupiehnate na pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />nangma in na nasempa Moses tungtawnin amate na sabbath siengtho na theisah a, thupiehnate, ngainate, le thukhamte na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A gilkiel ciengun amate vantung panin moh na pie hi, a dangta ciengun zong amate adingin suongpi panin tui na pulsah a, amate pieh dinga na ciemsa gamah pei-in a luo nadingun amate kungah na gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ahi vangin amate le ka pu ka pate kihisahin a ngawngkhauh vua, na thupiehnate a mang sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />amate in thu mang nuom loin, amate lahah na bawlsa na lamdangte ngaisutin zong a nei sih uhi; amate in a ngawng uh a khausah vua, a saltanna uh Egypt gamah kilekia ding a khentat uhi. Ahi vangin nangma na hi leh maw maisah dinga a kiging, mi lungsiet le mi hepi siem, lungduoina le itna kip tawh a kidim Pasien na hi a, nangma in amate na nuasie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in a kisung bawngno lim khat amahaw dingin a bawl vua, “Tami pen Egypt pana note ang peipi na pasien uh ahi hi,” ci-in nahpi-in note ang gensiet lai nangawnun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />nangma in a lien mama hepina na nei ziehin gamlahah amate na nuasie tuom sih a, sunin lam hil meii khuom in amate nuasie loin, zanin zong a pei nading uh lampi a vahsah ding mei khuom in amate nuasie lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangma in amate thu a hil dingin a hoi na hlagau na pie a, amau’ kam sung panin na manna an zong lakia loin, a dangta uh a phat nadingin tui na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangma zamtawng khat zong tasam loin nangma in amate kum sawmli sung na va a, a puonsilte uh sie loin a kengte uzong a pawm vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangma in amate tungah kumpi gamte le mite na pie a, amate tungah leimong ningkiu zosie na pie a, tuaci’n amate in Heshbon Kumpipa Sihon’ gam le Bashan Kumpipa Og’ gam a luo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangma in a suon a hlahte uh vana aasi za-in na pungsah a, a pu a pate lutin a luo ding vua na gensa gam sungah amate na peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n a suonlehlahte lutin khum gam a luo vua, amate mai-ah khum gama teng Canaan-te zogawpin, a nop bangbang vua a bawl dingun a khut sung vuah kumpite le a gam mite na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuale amate in kulpi tawh a ki-im khuopite, le leitang hoite la-in nei le lam namcin tawh a kidim innte a bulu vua, a kitosa tuikhuhte, lengga umte, olive umte, le neh thei singga tampitahte a luo uhi. Tuaci’n amate in tuate ne-in gilva-in a thau milmel vua, na hoina lienpi ziehin Topa’ hepina sungah a nuomsa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Hinanle amate in thu a mang sih vua, nang hing ledo-in na thukham a nuangat vua, nangma lam ang kinualekia nadingun amate thu a hil na kamsangte a that vua, tuaci’n mi gensietna lienpi a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin nangma in a galte uh’ khut sungah amate na pie a, a galte in amate a gimsah uhi. Tua ciengin a genthei hun ciengun nangma kungah ang kiko-in, nangma in vantung panin na za a, na khuotuona lienpi zalin a galte khut sung panin amate a hundam ding mite na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin a toidam zaw ciengun na mai-ah mawna a bawlkia vua, amate tungah thunei vaihawm dingin a galte khut sungah amate na nuasie hi. Ahi vangin nangma kungah amate hing kihei-in ang tau ciengun nangma in vantung panin na za a, na hepina ziehin amate tamveipi na hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuale na thukham lamah amate ang kinuale thei nadingun thu na hil hi. Hinanle kiphasah tahin amate a gamta vua, na thupiehnate mang loin a zui mi khat a nungtasah thei ahi nangma’ ngaina kipte tungah a khiel zawsop uhi. Amate lungkhauhin a liengko a lehei vua, a ngawng uh vaipuohin thu a mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kum tampi sung amate na thuoh kenkon a, na kamsangte tungtawnin nangma’ hlagau tawh amahaw thu na hil hi; hizongle amate in a ngai nuom sih uhi. Tua ahi ziehin nangma in amate khum gam mite’ khut sungah na piedawh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hizongnanle na hepina lien tawh amate na pum suhsiet sih a, zong na nuasie sih hi, bangzieh ahei cile nang pen hepina le khuotuona a nei Pasien na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tua ahi ziehin tu-in a vanglien, a thahat le a giinhuoi, thuciemna le itna kip a tudet kohaw’ Pasien aw, nangma in Assyria kumpite huna kipan tuni dongin ka kumpite uh, ka uliente uh, ka siempute uh, ka kamsangte uh, ka pu ka pate ule na mi zosiete tunga ang tung gimna zosie ei zangkhai ngaisutpieh malmal sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kote tunga ang tungsa thu zosie-ah nang na thutang hi, bangzieh ahei cile nangma in muonhuoi tahin sil na bawl zo a, kote gilo tahin ka gamta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />kote’ kumpipa, ka uliente uh, ka siempute uh, ka pu ka pate un na thukham zui loin na thupiehnate le na galgihnate a don sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nang na hoi mama zieha amate tunga na piehsa gam tanzau le gamhoi-ah amate omin, a kumpi gam sung vua a op laitah na ngawnun amate in nangma’ na sem loin a gitlo gamtatna panun a kinuale sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tu-in kote sal ka hi ta uhi, ka pu ka pate un a sunga pieng a gate le na hoite a neh thei dingun na piehsa gam sungah sal ka suoh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka mawna uh ziehin kote tungah ei uh dinga na koi kumpite tungah tua gam’ hauna teng a tung ta hi; amate in koma tung le ka ganhonte uh tungah a dei bang banga bawl theina thu a nei vua, nahpi tahin ka lung uh a kham hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuami thu teng zosie ziehin thukimna det khat bawlin lai ka giel vua, ka uliente uh, ka Levi-te ule ka siempute un tua lai tungah suoi a kai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua lai tunga suoikaite’ min pen tam teng ahi uhi; Hilkiah’ tapa gam uhpa Nehemiah le Zedekiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Seraiah, Azariah, Jeremiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pashhur, Amariah, Malchijah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hattush, Shebaniah, Malluch,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Harim, Meremoth, Obadiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Daniel, Ginnethon, Baruch,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Meshallum, Abijah, Mijamin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maaziah, Bilgal, le Shemaiah-te; tam teng pen siempute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale Levi-te: Azaniah’ tapa Jeshua, Henadad’ tate Binui le Kadmiel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a kithuopite Shebaniah, Hodiah, Kelita, Pelaiah, Hanan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mica, Rehob, Hashabiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zaccur, Sherebiah, Shebaniah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hodiah, Bani, le Baninu ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipi makaite: Parosh, Pahath-moab, Elam, Zatthu, Bani,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bunni, Azgad, Bebai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Adonijah, Bigvai, Adin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ater, Hezekiah, Azzur,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hodiah, Hashum, Bezai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hariph, Anathoth, Nebai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Magpiash, Meshullam, Hezir,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meshezabel, Zadok, Jaddua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pelatiah, Hanan, Anaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hoshea, Hananiah, Hasshub,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Halohesh, Pilha, Shobek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rehum, Hashabnah, Maaseiah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahiah, Hanan, Anan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Malluch, Harim, Baanah-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A om lai mite, siempute, Levi-te, tunkot cingte, lasate, biehinn tuonvaite, Pasien thukham zui dinga tua gam mite tawh a kikhenkhie mi zosie’ a zite, a tate, a tanute, pilna le theitelna a nei zosie in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />a sanggamte zopin a uliente a zui vua, Pasien’ nasem Moses in a pieh Pasien’ thukham zui-in, eite’ Topa ahi Topa thupiehnate zosie, le a ngainate le a thukhamte a zui nadingun kiciemna a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gamdang mite kungah ka tanute ka mo hlah sih ding vua, ka tapate’ zi dingin zong amau’ tanute ka la sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua gam mite in Sabbath ni-in van hile, an hile zua dinga ang tawi uleh, Sabbath ni le ni siengtho ni khat popo-in amate tung panin ka lei sih ding uhi; tuale kote in a kum sagina-ah lo bawl loin, leibate zong ka pau nget sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />I Pasien uh’ biehinn sunga nasep nadingin shekel khat’ sethum-suo-sekhat pieh ding ka mawpuoh uh ahi hi, ci-in ka kiciem uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua khu a kiguol anlumte, manmana kipie an tawh biehnate, manman a kipie meihal biehnate, sabbath-te, hladet nite, a kisesa pawite, a siengtho silpiehte, le Israel-te thoidam nading, mawna zieha biehnate le i Pasien uh’ inn sunga nasep nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thukham laibu sungah a kigiel ma bangin a kise hunin a kumkumin Topa i Pasien uh’ maitam tunga taw dingin a pupa uh’ innkuon zui-in Pasien’ biehinn sungah sing silpieh zong ka tut nadingun, siempute, Levi-te, le mipite in ai ka san uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka leitang pan vua a pieng anpalte, singkung zosie uh panin ga masate, a kumkumin Topa’ biehinn sunga tawi dingin ka kiciem uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />thukham laibu sungah a kigiel ma bangin a suoh masa tapate le a suoh masa gantate zong Pasien’ biehinn sunga a nasem siempute kunga peipi ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />le Pasien’ biehinn dan sunga a om siempute kungah annel kilommeh masa pente, silpiehte, singga zosie, sathau le lenggazu-te peipi ding, le khuoneute zosie-ah sesawm-suo- sekhat a khonte pen Levi-te ahi ziehin lo-a a pieng se sawm-suo-sekhatte zong Levi-te tunga puoh dingin ka vaihawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuale Levi-te in se sawm-suo-sekhat a san ciengun, Levi-te tawh Aaron’ suon siempute a omton ding uhi; tuale Levi-te in se sawm-suo-sekhat sung panin se sawm-suo-sekhat ma khensawnin Pasien’ biehinnpi sung vankholna tapkuong sungah a peipi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Israel mite le Levi’ suonte in mun siengtho vanzahte koina, siempute tuonvai sepna, le tunkot cingte le lasate opna mun vankholna-ah lenggazu, le sathau kipiete a peipi ding uhi. Topa i Pasien uh’ biehinn don loin i om sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Jerusalem ah mipi makai teng a teng uhi; tuale a omlai mite sawm-ah-khat in khuopi siengtho Jerusalem-a teng dingin ai a san vua, sawm-ah-kuote khuopi dangte-ah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale mite in Jerusalem-a a teng dingin kiphal taha kipumpiehte a pahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam teng pen Jerusalem-a teng gamkhen uhpite ahi uhi; ahi vangin Judah khuopite-ah Israel-te, siempute, Levi-te, biehinnpi sunga tuonvaite, le Solomon nasemte’ suon le hlahte a teng vua, a khuopite ciet vuah amau’ neisa ciet tawh a teng uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah-te le Benjamin-te sung panin Jerusalem ah mi pawlkhat a teng uhi. Judah-te sung panin: Perez’ suon Mahalalel’ tapa, Shephatiah’ tapa, Amariah’ tapa, Zechariah’ tapa, Uzziah’ tapa, Athaiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />le Shilon’ suon Zechariah’ tapa, Joiarib’ tapa, Adaiah’ tapa, Hazaiah’ tapa, Kolhozeh’ tapa, Baruch’ tapa, Maaseiah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem-a Perez’ suonte zosie mihat galhang zali sawmguh le giet pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tam teng pen Benjamin suonte ahi uhi: Jesaih’ tapa, Ithiel’ tapa, Maaseiah’ tapa, Kolaiah’ tapa, Pedaih’ tapa, Joed’ tapa, Mashullum’ tapa Sallu ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sanggamte Gabbai, Sallai ahi vua, mi zakuo sawmni le giet pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zichri’ tapa Joel pen amau’ makai pa ahi hi. Hassenuah’ tapa Judah pen khuopi uh a nina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siempute sung panin: Jedaiah, Joiarib’ tapa, Jachin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien’ biehinn vaisai pa Ahitub’ tapa, Meraioth’ tapa, Zadok’ tapa , Meshullam’ tapa, Hilkiah tapa, Seraiah’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />le biehinn nasem amau’ kithuopite tawh mi zagiet sawmni le ni pha uhi; tuale Malchijah’ tapa, Pashur’ tapa, Zechariah’ tapa, Amzi’ tapa, Pelaliah’ tapa, Jeroham’ tapa, Adaiah’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />le a kithuopite, pupa innkuon lutangte tawh mi zani sawmli ni pha uhi; tuale Immer’ tapa, Meshillemoth’ tapa, Ahzai’ tapa, Azarel’ tapa, Amashai’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />le amau’ kithuopi a thahat galhangte tawh mi zakhat sawmni le giet pha uhi; amau’ makai pen Haggedolim’ tapa Zabdiel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale Levi-te sung panin: Bunni’ tapa, Hashabiah’ tapa, Azrikim’ tapa, Hasshub’ tapa, Shemaiah’ tapa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />le Pasien’ biehinn pulam nasem vaisai Levi-te’ makaite ahi Shabbethai le Jozabad;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />le lungdamko thungetna a pan dinga a makai Asaph’ tapa, Zabdi’ tapa, Mica’ tapa, Mattaniah’ tapa, le ama’ kithuopite lahah a nina pa Bakbukiah, le Jeduthun’ tapa; le Galal’ tapa, Shammua’ tapa, Abda ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khuopi siengtho-a om Levi-te a unpi-in zani sawmgiet le li pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tunkot cingte sung panin: Akkub, Talmon, le amau’ kithuopite tawh mi zakhat sawmsagi ni pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A omlai Israel-te, siempute, le Levi-te pen Judah gam khuopi zosie-a amau’ luo leitang cietah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin biehinnpi tuonvaite ahile Ophel muolbo-ah a teng uhi; tuale Ziha le Gishpa in biehinn tuonvaite a uh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem-a Levi-te a uhpa Mica’ tapa, Mattaniah’ tapa, Hashbiah’ tapa, Bani’ tapa, Uzzi pen Asaph’ suon lasate ahi a, ama pen Pasien’ biehinn nasepna-ah vaisai khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate tawh kisai-in kumpipa thupieh khat om ahi ziehin, lasate adingin nisielin neh le dawn a kisam banga pieh ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah’ tapa Zerah’ suonte khat, Meshezabel’ tapa Pethahiah pen mipite tawh kisai-a kumpipa’ khut nei-ah thu zosie a saipa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuale khuoneute le a lote tawh kisai-in, Judah mite pawlkhat Kiriath-arba le a khuoneute, Dibon le a khuoneute, Jekabzeel le a khuoneute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jeshua, Moladah, Beth-pelet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazar-shual, Beer-sheba le a khuoneute
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ziklag, Meconah le a khuoneute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />En-rimmon, Zorah le Jarmut,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zanoah, Adullam le a khuoneute, Lachish le a lote, Azekah le a khuoneute-ah a teng uhi. Tuaci’n Beer-sheba panin Hinnom Kuom dongah phuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamin mite in zong Geba lam panin, Michmash, Aija, Bethel le a khuoneute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anathoth, Nob, Ananiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazor, Ramah, Gittaim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hadid, Zeboiim, Neballat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lod, le Ono, le khutsiemte kuomah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Levi pawlkhen kimkhatte Benjamin gamah kigawm uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shealtiel’ tapa Zerubbabel le Jeshua tawh a peito siempute le Levi-te tam teng ahi hi: Seraiah, Jeremiah, Ezra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amariah, Malluch, Hattush,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Shecaniah, Rehum, Meremoth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Iddo, Ginnethoi, Abijah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mijamin, Maadiah, Bilgah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Shemaiah, Joiarib, Jedaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sallu, Amok, Hilkiah, Jedaiah-te ahi uhi. Tam teng pen Jeshua khan sunga siempute le a kithuopite lahah a lamkaite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levi-te: Jeshua, Binnui, Kadmiel, Sherebiah, Judah, le Mattaniah ahi a, a kithuopite tawh lungdamkona la makaite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Biehpiehna sungah amate tawh Bakbukiah, Unno le a kithuopite kigalsai-in a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jeshua pen Joiakim’ pa, Joiakim pen Eliashib’ pa, Eliashib pen Joiada’ pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joiada pen Jonathan’ pa, Jonathan pen Jaddua’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joiakim hun sunga pupa innkuon lutang ahi siempute: Seraiah suon panin Meraiah, Jeremiah suon panin Hananiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ezra suon panin Meshullam; Amariah suon panin Jehohanan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Malluchi suon panin Jonathan, Shebaniah suon panin Joseph;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Harim suon panin Adna; Meraioth suon panin Helkai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Iddo suon panin Zechariah, Ginnethon suon panin Meshullam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abijah suon panin Zichri, Miniamin suonte, Moadiah suon panin Piltai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bilgah suon panin Shammua; Shemaiah suon panin Jehonathan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Joiarib suon panin Mattenai; Jedaiah suon panin Uzzi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sallai suon panin Kallai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amok suon panin Eber; Hilkiah suon panin Hashabiah; Jedaiah suon panin Nethanel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eliashib, Joiada, Johanan, le Jaddua-te’ khan sungin Levi-te pen pupa innkuon lutangin na kiciemte hi; Persia-te Darius’ uh hun cieng dongin zong siempute a na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pupa innkuonte’ lutang Levi-te pen Eliashib’ tapa Johanan hun dongin Khang Tangthu Laibu sungah kiciemte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Levi makaite: Hashabiah, Sherebiah, le Kadmiel’ tapa Jeshua-te le a kithuopite tawh ahi vua, Pasien mi David’ thupiehna tawh kizui-in a kidawnga phatna la sa ding le lungdamko dingin a pawl pawlin a kikhel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mattaniah, Bakbukiah, Obadiah, Meshullam, Talmon, Akkub-te pen vankoina tunkotte a cing tunkot cingte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tam teng pen Jozadak’ tapa Jeshua, a tapa Joiakim hun sung le gam uhpa Nehemiah, siempu pa le laithei pa Ezra hun sunga nasemte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem kulpi apna-ah daltuote, harp, le lyre-te tawh lungdamko-in la a sa vua, lungdam kipahna tawh apna a bawl dingin Jerusalem ah Levi-te a peipi thei nadingun a opna uh muncin tengah amate a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jerusalem kim le Netophah-te’ khuoneute panin lasa honpite a kikhawm uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Beth-gilgal pan le Geba gam le Azmaveth gam panin zong a kikhawm uhi; azieh pen lasate in Jerusalem kimvelah amate dingin khuoneute a lam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuale siempute le Levi-te kisiensuo-in amate in mite, tunkotte le kulpite a siensuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in kulpi tungah Judah makaite ka zawpi a, lampei kawmin phatna la sa dingin mi honpi khen ni-in ka se hi. Honkhat pen ziet lam manaw-in Buathah Tunkot kulzangah a pei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tuale amate nua-ah Hoshaiah le Judah uliente alang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Azariah, Ezra, Meshullam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Judah, Benjamin, Shemaiah, Jeremiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />le pengkulte a tawi a khangdawng siempu pawlkhat: Asaph, a tapa Zaccur, a tapa Micaiah, a tapa Mattaniah, a tapa Shemaih, a tapa Jonathan, a tapa Zechariah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />ama’ tanau Shemaiah, Azarel, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Nethanel, Judah, le Hanani-te, Pasien’ mizah ahi David’ tumthei lasahnate tawh zui-in, amau’ mai-ah laithei pa Ezra a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate masang Tuinah Tunkot panin kulpi katona David’ khuopi kalei-ah a peito vua, David’ innpi tunglam nisuona lam Tui Tunkot lam zuonin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Vei lamah lungdamko adang pawlte a pei vua, keima in mipi pawlkhat tawh kul tungah amate ka zui hi. Meikhuh Tausang panin Kulpi Tanzau-ah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />khum panin Ephraim Tunkot, tua ciengin Tunkot Lui, tua ciengin Nga Tunkot, tua ciengin Hananel Tausang, tua ciengin Zakhat Tausang, tua ciengin Tuu Tunkot-ah a pei uhi; tuale Thong Tunkot-ah amate a khawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien’ biehinn sungah lungdamko la pawl nite le uliente alang tawh ka ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />siempu Eliakim, Maaseiah, Miniamin, Mikaiah, Elioenai, Zechariah, le Hananiah-te in a pengkul uh a tawi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuale Maaseiah, Shemaiah, Eleazar, Uzzi, Jehohanan, Malchijah, Elam, Ezer-te zong a om uhi. Lasate in Jezrahiah makai-in la a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nahpi taha a lungdam dingin Pasien in amate a bawl ziehin amate in zong khum ni-in biehpiehna lienpi bawlin a lungdam vua, numei le naupangte zong a lungdam uhi. A gamlapi panin Jerusalem’ guolnopna kiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Khum ni-in thukham sunga a om bangin siempute le Levi-te tanh dinga khuopite neisa lote pan kaikhop dinga a kipie nate, anpalte, le sawm-a-khatte kikholna ahi inndeite tunga vaihawm ding mi kise hi; azieh pen na sem siempute le Levi-te tungah Judah a lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />David le a tapa Solomon’ thupiehna tawh kizui-in lasate le tunkot cingte ma bangin amate in a Pasien uh’ nasepna le siensuo nasepnate a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile hun sawtveipi lai David le Asaph-te hun sungin lasate ading, Pasien tunga lungdamkona le phatna lasate adingin makai khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Zerubbabel le Nehemiah hun lai-in Israel mi zosie in lasate le tunkot cingte adingin a nisim tanh uh a pie uhi. Amate in Levi-te ading a tuomkoi uhi. Levi-te in Aaron’ suonte adingin a tuomkoi sawn uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum ni-in amate in mipite’ zahin Moses’ thukham laibu a sim uhi; tuale Pasien’ mite kikhopna sungah Ammon-te le Moab-te a lut thei ngai lo nading uh a kigiel lai kimu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />azieh pen amate in an le tui tawh Israel-te na lamdot loin amate a gausam dingin Balaam na ciel zawsop uhi. Ahi vangin kohaw’ Pasien in tua awsie teng thupha-in ei heipieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mipite in tua thukham a zah ciengun Israel sung panin gamdang suon zosie a tuomkhen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum hun masangin eite’ Pasien’ innpi sunga vankholna inndeite uh dinga kise Tobiah tawh a kithei siempu Eliashib in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tu masang lai-in Levi-te, lasate le tunkot cingte tunga a thupieh tawh kizui-a kipie ding ahi an tawh biehna, gimnamtui, vanzahte, sawm-ah-khat a kipie an, lenggazu, sathau, le siempute dinga a kipie nate koina dinga kizang innkhan golpi khat, Tobiah adingin na bawlpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babylon Kumpi Artaxerxes in a uh zaw a kum sawmthum le nina kumin ama kunga ka hawziehin tam thu a pien hunin Jerusalem ah kei ka om kha sih hi. Keima in bakhat zaw ciengin kumpipa tung panin phalna ka ngen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuale Jerusalem ah ka peikia hi. Tua ciengin keima in Tobiah adingin Pasien biehinn huong sungah Elishiab in inndei khat a na bawlpiehna thu, a sil hoi lo bawlte ka va mukhie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale ka lung a thah mama a, inndei sung panin Tobiah’ van zosie ka paimang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in thu pie-in, amate in inndeite a siensuo vua, tua sungah Pasien’ biehinn vanzahte, an tawh biehna le gimnamtuite ka koikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Levi-te’ tanh dinga kisete amate tungah kipie lo ahi ziehin a lo ciet vuah Levi-te le lasate a kuonkia ta uhi, ci thu zong keima in ka va thei kha ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n uliente tungah ka lung a kim sih a, “Bang dinga Pasien’ innpi kinuasie dawh ta ahei?” ka ci hi. Tuale keima in amate ka kaikhawm a, a mun ciet vuah ka koikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah zosie in antang, lenggazu le sathau sung panin sawm-ah-khat hing peipi-in vankoina innte-ah ang tut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale keima in vankoina innte a kem dingin siempu Shelemiah, laithei Zadok, le Levi-te Pedaih, le amate a hu dingin Mattaniah’ tapa Zaccur, a tapa Hanan-te ka se hi, bangzieh ahei cile amate pen mi muonhuoite-in kingaisun hi; tuale amau’ sep ding tavuon pen a kithuopite tungah neh le dawn hawmpieh ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw, ka Pasien, tami thu tawh kisai-in keima ei phawh inlen, ka Pasien’ innpi le ama’ nasepna dinga ka bawl na hoite ei suhmangpieh sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in keima in Judah mite sungah sabbath ni-in lenggazu suhin, buphaite khawmin, laa tunga a van guon ule sabbath ni-in laa tungah lenggazu, lengga, theiba gate, le van namcin zong guongin Jerusalem-a ang puoh uh zong ka mu hi; tuale khum ni-in a anzua uh a hoi lona thu amate tungah ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuopi sunga teng Tyre-te in zong ngasa le van namkim ang puo vua, sabbath ni-in tuate Judah mite tung le Jerusalem-ah a zua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah mi thupite tungah ka lung a kim sih a, amate kungah, “Sabbath ni buasah a, tami sil hoi lo na bawlte uh bang ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na pu na pate uh tam banga a na gamtat ziehun i Pasien in eite tung le tam khuopi tungah tam bang gimna zosie ang tunsah hi lo amah? Tua hi napi-in note in sabbath buasahna tawh Israel tungah lungthahna na tut be uhi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sabbath masang, Jerusalem tunkotte-ah khuo mut patin kotpite a kikhah nadingin ka sawl a, sabbath tawp zaw masangsie a kihon lo nadingin thu ka pie hi. Keima in sabbath ni-a ang kipuo van poma a lut thei lo nadinga a khaam dingin tunkot tengah ka nasemte pawlkhat ka pangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin sumbawlte le van namkim zuate khatvei ni vei Jerusalem pulamah a gieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima in amate ka phawhsie a, a kung vuah, “Bang dinga kulpi mai-a gieh na hi uh ahei? Nang giekia poma uleh kang dopbawl vawt sih ding hi,” ka ci hi. Tua huna kipan sabbath ni-in amate ang pei nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Siengtho tahin tua sabbath a kitan thei nadingin a kisiensuosa-in amate pei-in tunkot teng a cin nadingun Levi-te thu ka pie hi. Ka Pasien aw, tam thu-ah zong nangma in nei angvanna tawh keima ei phawh inlen, a lien mama na itna kip dung zui-in kei ei pengsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in keima in zong Ashdod, Ammon, le Moab numeite tawh a kinung Jew mite ka mu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tuale a tate uh alang in Ashdod ham a zang vua, tuale amate in Judah ham zang thei loin minam tuomtuomte’ ham a zangzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate phawhsie-in ka samsie a, pawlkhat vuo-in, pawlkhat a sambung vuah ka luoi gawp hi; tuale keima in Pasien’ min tawh amate ka kiciemsah a, “Na tanute uh a tapate uh’ zi dingin na pie sih ding vua, a tanute uzong noma le na tapate’ zi dingin na la poma sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua bang numeite ziehin Israel Kumpipa Solomon khiel hi lo amah? Minam tampite lahah ama tawh a kibang kumpi khat zong om loin, a Pasien in ama it a, Israel zosie tungah kumpi dingin Pasien in ama koi hi; ahi vangin gamdang numeite in ama nangawn a khielsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahile gamdang numeite tenpina ziehin tami sietna lienpite zosie bawlin ka Pasien tung vua a zuoutat dingin kote in na thu ngai ding ka hi uh amah?” ka cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuale siempu lien pa Eliashib’ tapa Jehoiada’ tapate khat pen Horon-te Sanballat’ mahpa na hi hi; keima in ka kung panin ama ka delmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka Pasien aw, amate in siempu nasepna le siempute le Levi-te’ thuciemna a buasah ziehun amate na thei ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua bangin gamdang tawh a kizom nate zosie panin amate ka siensuo a, siempute le Levi-te a nasep ngai ma vuah ka semsahkia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tuale a kise hun cienga vah ding sing tawh biehna le anpal tawh biehna ding zong ka vaihawmpieh hi. Ka Pasien aw, a hoi lamin ei phawh bo in.
  </para>
</usx>
